<view class="page-container">
  <view class="nav-bar" style="padding-top: {{safeAreaTop}}px;">
    <view class="nav-content">
      <view class="back-btn" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="handleBack">
        <view class="icon-back"></view>
      </view>
      <text class="nav-title">通知设置</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  
  <view style="height: {{safeAreaTop + 44}}px;"></view>

  <view class="content-wrapper">
    <view class="card-box">
      
      <view class="setting-item">
        <view class="item-text-group">
          <text class="item-title">消息推送</text>
          <text class="item-desc">开启后可收到服务状态变更提醒</text>
        </view>
        <switch checked="{{settings.notification}}" color="#ffd300" bindchange="handleNotificationChange" />
        
        <view class="absolute-divider"></view>
      </view>

      <view class="setting-item">
        <text class="item-title">通知显示具体内容</text>
        <switch checked="{{settings.detail}}" color="#ffd300" bindchange="handleDetailChange" />
      </view>

    </view>
    
    <view class="hint-text">
      注：如果无法开启，请检查手机系统设置中微信的通知权限是否打开。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>